        "line": 381,
        "text": "theorem reference_profile_bounds {c0 u L v c M A : ℝ}\n    (hc : 0 < c) (hcl : c ≤ |c0|) (hch : |c0| ≤ M)\n    (hs : |PulseGrowth.slotMagnitude u L v| ≤ A) :\n    |PrimaryODE.referenceProfile c0 u L v| ≤ M * (1 + A) ∧\n    |1 / PrimaryODE.referenceProfile c0 u L v| ≤ 1 / c"
